cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Literature Evidence MCP: provenance-first scholarly metadata server"
abstract: >-
  An MCP server for literature workflows that keeps every scientific verdict
  explicit about its provenance. It retrieves metadata from fixed provider
  origins, verifies quotes only as literal text matches, checks retraction and
  correction notices in both Crossref relation directions, audits citation
  graphs without treating citations as retractions, and records evidence in an
  append-only hash-chained ledger.
authors:
  - family-names: "Furox"
    given-names: "Art"
version: 0.5.1
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Furox-Art/literature-evidence-mcp"
url: "https://github.com/Furox-Art/literature-evidence-mcp"
keywords:
  - literature review
  - research provenance
  - retraction checking
  - evidence ledger
  - mcp server
  - scholarly metadata
